window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-036-c4eb184cd09f3086.json"]={sha256:"c4eb184cd09f3086beae64b905e418a0add0b9cb2460f2696e8d9d959a54d494",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-c7f82e9e01d52ccf","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5155","title":"RFC 5155: DNS Security (DNSSEC) Hashed Authenticated Denial of Existence","titleEn":"RFC 5155: DNS Security (DNSSEC) Hashed Authenticated Denial of Existence","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-557318b9eed90a83","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9276","title":"RFC 9276: Guidance for NSEC3 Parameter Settings","titleEn":"RFC 9276: Guidance for NSEC3 Parameter Settings","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-036","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-036","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-037","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5936"],"title":"AXFR：完整區域傳送與 SOA 封口","titleEn":"AXFR: complete zone transfer and SOA closure","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受11000/1000次離線呼叫；部署設定另參照RFC9276現行指引，本課不發出大量DNS查詢。 交接時須能核對：交付 nsec3-work.csv與零迭代邊界測試，清楚標歷史演算法分析。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Accept11000/1000 offline calls; consult RFC9276 for deployment guidance, and send no bulk DNS queries. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver nsec3-work.csv and a zero-iteration boundary test labeled as historical algorithm analysis.","difference":"依message與RR索引串接TCP資料，保留SOA serial而非只計位元組。","differenceEn":"Reassemble TCP by message and RR indices, retaining SOA serials rather than counting bytes only.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["NSEC3 iterations欄位代表初始雜湊之外的額外輪次；本課分析舊紀錄，不建議提高迭代值。\n教學基準：1000*(10+1) = 11000 hash calls；對照：1000*(0+1) = 1000 hash calls。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","AXFR以開始與結尾SOA標示傳送邊界；只收到若干RR不能宣稱完整區域。\n教學基準：10000*120+2*100 = 1200200 B；對照：15000*120+2*100 = 1800200 B。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["NSEC3 iterations count rounds after the initial hash; this course audits historical records and does not recommend higher iterations.\nTeaching baseline: 1000*(10+1) = 11000 hash calls; comparison: 1000*(0+1) = 1000 hash calls. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","AXFR uses opening and closing SOA records to delimit a transfer; receiving some RRs does not establish completeness.\nTeaching baseline: 10000*120+2*100 = 1200200 B; comparison: 15000*120+2*100 = 1800200 B. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-046","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3168"],"title":"ECN：標記比例與封包遺失分開","titleEn":"ECN: separating congestion marking from loss","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受11000/1000次離線呼叫；部署設定另參照RFC9276現行指引，本課不發出大量DNS查詢。 交接時須能核對：交付 nsec3-work.csv與零迭代邊界測試，清楚標歷史演算法分析。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Accept11000/1000 offline calls; consult RFC9276 for deployment guidance, and send no bulk DNS queries. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver nsec3-work.csv and a zero-iteration boundary test labeled as historical algorithm analysis.","difference":"建立ECT、CE、送達、遺失與回報欄，分母明確是已到達的ECT封包。","differenceEn":"Record ECT, CE, delivery, loss and feedback with delivered ECT packets as the explicit denominator.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["NSEC3 iterations欄位代表初始雜湊之外的額外輪次；本課分析舊紀錄，不建議提高迭代值。\n教學基準：1000*(10+1) = 11000 hash calls；對照：1000*(0+1) = 1000 hash calls。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","ECN讓壅塞可由標記回報；CE標記不是封包已遺失，也不是無須降低負載。\n教學基準：300/10000*100 = 3 %；對照：900/10000*100 = 9 %。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["NSEC3 iterations count rounds after the initial hash; this course audits historical records and does not recommend higher iterations.\nTeaching baseline: 1000*(10+1) = 11000 hash calls; comparison: 1000*(0+1) = 1000 hash calls. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","ECN can signal congestion by marking; CE neither means packet loss nor permission to ignore congestion.\nTeaching baseline: 300/10000*100 = 3 %; comparison: 900/10000*100 = 9 %. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-8d2ae649a46e8331","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5936","title":"RFC 5936: DNS Zone Transfer Protocol (AXFR)","titleEn":"RFC 5936: DNS Zone Transfer Protocol (AXFR)","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-35496a19250e2fef","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3168","title":"RFC 3168: The Addition of Explicit Congestion Notification (ECN) to IP","titleEn":"RFC 3168: The Addition of Explicit Congestion Notification (ECN) to IP","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
